The '''Australian Surveillance Goon''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{Zone|Wizard Tower (Rift)|Tower Portal}} and {{Zone|Barry Center}}. They were initially introduced as part of {{rn|YouTube|Candypat}}'s {{AN|Public Surveillance}} perk and required players to check in every {{Green|30}} minutes. Failing to do so granted a {{Red|10%}} stat debuff. The duration was later increased to {{Green|12}} hours and added as part of {{rn|MVP+|MelonKingDe}}'s Minister perks.

